# UX workflow: create a Track directly, extend its Page structure, and replay history.
# Purpose: validates frictionless Track creation, contiguous Pages, and that
# Undo/Redo restores both domain state and the visible active Track/Page.
# This subsumes the former isolated structure-track-redo-ui workflow.
# Expect: capture_match:page_2_creation_undone=track_2_creation_redone, capture_changed:page_2_creation_undone=track_2_creation_undone, capture_match:page_2_created=page_2_creation_redone

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen track_1_pattern_1

# Track creation is owned by the Clip Launcher. Return to the matrix, move up
# to the Track row, then horizontally to the sole T2 add header.
150 tap LEFT_TOP 60
500 encoder NAV -0.01
600 button LEFT_CENTER down
680 encoder NAV 0.01
760 button LEFT_CENTER up
1000 capture screen track_2_add_preview
1200 tap NAV 60
1500 capture screen track_2_type_instrument
1700 tap NAV 60
2180 capture screen track_2_pattern_1

# Pattern focus opens its retained editor with a NAV tap; the first-rank +Page
# action then authors the next contiguous Page.
2280 tap NAV 60
2880 capture screen track_2_pattern_editor
3080 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
3300 tap LEFT_TOP 60
4430 capture screen page_2_created

# Back returns to the Clip Launcher first. A second Back opens the global View
# Selector, where LEFT_CENTER undoes Page 2 while retaining Track 2.
5160 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5360 tap LEFT_TOP 60
6430 tick
6490 capture screen selector_undo_pattern_ready
6540 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
8040 capture screen selector_undo_track_ready
8140 tap LEFT_TOP 60
8340 capture screen page_2_creation_undone

# Undo Track 2 from the same global surface; the matrix must return to T1 only.
8440 tap LEFT_TOP 60
9510 tick
9570 capture screen selector_undo_track_ready_again
9620 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
11120 capture screen selector_redo_track_ready
11220 tap LEFT_TOP 60
11420 capture screen track_2_creation_undone

# Redo Track 2, then Page 2. Both domain and focused UI must be restored.
11520 tap LEFT_TOP 60
12590 tick
12650 capture screen selector_redo_track_ready_again
12700 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
14200 capture screen selector_redo_pattern_ready
14300 tap LEFT_TOP 60
14500 capture screen track_2_creation_redone

14600 tap LEFT_TOP 60
15670 tick
15730 capture screen selector_redo_pattern_ready_again
15780 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
17280 capture screen selector_undo_pattern_ready_restored
17380 tap LEFT_TOP 60
17580 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
17920 tap LEFT_TOP 60
18300 capture screen page_2_creation_redone
